            "value" : "Si alguien compartio su plan familiar o de pareja contigo, ingresa el codigo de invitacion a continuacion."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se alguem compartilhou seu plano familiar ou de casal com voce, insira o codigo de convite abaixo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If they don't have the app yet, they'll get instructions to download it." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the main text in the \"Invite Member\" sheet, explaining that if the invited user doesn't have the app, they'll be provided with instructions to download it.",
